{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bell rings. Students rush outside. Neon, denim, loud. Excitement, tension, some squealing.\u00a0 This is what the school day is really all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogueball</strong> was invented right here, on this court in 1988. Its traditions have been passed down by the Big Kids who rule the Five Cliques.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every one wants to be on the court as a Baller today, but only one team will be most triumphant when recess ends...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a team captain today, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft </strong>your team from <strong>100+</strong> early 90s schoolyard characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-battle</strong> your way through the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Synergize</strong>. Will you stick to your own clique, or discover radical combinations?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a fast-paced Roguelike team building auto-battler. It's Rogueball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735200?t=1760634971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735200/acfedef7d110fd2928a617a1285ff2ffa8e3e5a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760634971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735200/b08a4963e5a3b1b70d5fb7c8f946529ce0ecb056/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760634971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735200/b08a4963e5a3b1b70d5fb7c8f946529ce0ecb056/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760634971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bell rings. Students rush outside. Neon, denim, loud. Excitement, tension, some squealing.\u00a0 This is what the school day is really all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogueball</strong> was invented right here, on this court in 1988. Its traditions have been passed down by the Big Kids who rule the Five Cliques.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every one wants to be on the court as a Baller today, but only one team will be most triumphant when recess ends...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a team captain today, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft </strong>your team from <strong>100+</strong> early 90s schoolyard characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-battle</strong> your way through the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Synergize</strong>. Will you stick to your own clique, or discover radical combinations?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a fast-paced Roguelike team building auto-battler. It's Rogueball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Obfuscate Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735200/a2f706a065a01af0ace7bd4c186d20ab2425c367/header.jpg?t=1760634971","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></